{"paper": "SSC-DelhiPoliceHC-14-Oct-2022-Shift2.pdf", "status": "ok", "mode": "sequential", "splitter": "qdot", "section_slice": true, "extracted_count": 20, "tagged_count": 20, "questions": [{"n": 1, "text": "Two numbers are, respectively, 25% and 60% more than a third number. What is the ratio of the first two numbers?", "options": [{"text": "25 : 32", "added": false}, {"text": "5 : 8", "added": false}, {"text": "33 : 25", "added": false}, {"text": "12 : 19", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Ratio-Proportion", "sub": "ratio-basics", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 2, "text": "The value of (a - b)3 + (b - c)3 + (c - a)3 is:", "options": [{"text": "3abc", "added": false}, {"text": "3(a + b)(b + c)(c + a)", "added": false}, {"text": "0", "added": false}, {"text": "3(a – b)(b – c)(c – a)", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Algebra", "sub": "identities", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 3, "text": "", "options": [{"text": "17248 cm3", "added": false}, {"text": "17250 cm3", "added": false}, {"text": "17244 cm3", "added": false}, {"text": "17246 cm3", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": true, "topic": "Mensuration 3D", "sub": "cylinder", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 4, "text": "", "options": [], "options_source": "missing", "image_only": true, "topic": "Number System", "sub": "fractions-decimals", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 5, "text": "If a person walks at 6 km/h instead of 5 km/h, he would have walked 5 km more. What is the distance travelled by him at the speed of 5 km/h?", "options": [{"text": "15 km", "added": false}, {"text": "25 km", "added": false}, {"text": "18 km", "added": false}, {"text": "24 km", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Time-Speed-Distance", "sub": "basic-tsd", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 6, "text": "A sum of Rs.16,340 is lent at a simple interest of 13% per annum. If the interest is Rs. X after 5 years, then the sum of the digits of X is _________.", "options": [{"text": "19", "added": false}, {"text": "10", "added": false}, {"text": "15", "added": false}, {"text": "18", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Simple Interest", "sub": "si-formula", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 7, "text": "", "options": [], "options_source": "missing", "image_only": true, "topic": "Algebra", "sub": "expression-values", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 8, "text": "If a solid cuboid of dimensions 10 × 5 × 6 is melted so as to make cubes of unit length, what will be the cost of all such cubes formed, if the cost of one cube is Rs.20?", "options": [{"text": "Rs.5,000", "added": false}, {"text": "Rs.8,000", "added": false}, {"text": "Rs.3,000", "added": false}, {"text": "Rs.6,000", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Mensuration 3D", "sub": "conversion-and-melting", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 9, "text": "Find the average of the first five prime numbers.", "options": [{"text": "7.8", "added": false}, {"text": "6.5", "added": false}, {"text": "8.7", "added": false}, {"text": "5.6", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Average", "sub": "simple-average", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 10, "text": "A vegetable seller sells potatoes at ₹22/kg which he purchased at ₹18/kg. But he gives only 850 grams of potatoes instead of 1 kg while selling. What is the actual percentage profit earned by the seller?", "options": [{"text": "30.45%", "added": false}, {"text": "42.79%", "added": false}, {"text": "45.29%", "added": false}, {"text": "43.79%", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Profit-Loss", "sub": "dishonest-dealer", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 11, "text": "Shiva borrowed a sum of Rs.12,000 from a finance company at the rate of 20% p.a. compound interest, compounded annually. What is the CI for a period of 2 years?", "options": [{"text": "Rs.5,280", "added": false}, {"text": "